    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-default/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0504,
      "audio_seconds": 5.9443,
      "rtf": 0.0085,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.5083
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-default/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0444,
      "audio_seconds": 5.5263,
      "rtf": 0.008,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.43
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-default/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0694,
      "audio_seconds": 7.4652,
      "rtf": 0.0093,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.5596
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/fastpitch-default/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 0.0409,
      "audio_seconds": 5.0271,
      "rtf": 0.0081,
      "sample_rate": 22050,
      "peak_abs": 0.4172
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
